<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Type Scale &amp; Typography</h1>
<p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">A living typography page for quick visual checks. Headings are set in <strong>Young Serif</strong>, body text in <strong>Public Sans</strong>. For colours, buttons, and components see the <a href="/style/" class="link-red">Style Guide</a>.</p>

<section class="bg-[var(--surface)] border rounded p-4 mb-8">
  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Fonts Used</h2>
  <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 list-disc pl-6 mt-2">
    <li><strong>Headings &amp; emphasis:</strong> <a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Young+Serif" class="link-red">Young Serif</a>: applied to <code>h1–h6</code> and <code>.font-bold</code>/<code>.font-semibold</code></li>
    <li><strong>Body/UI:</strong> <a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Public+Sans" class="link-red">Public Sans</a>: weights 300–700 plus italics, loaded via Google Fonts in <code>base.njk</code></li>
    <li><strong>Monospace:</strong> Tailwind's <code>font-mono</code> stack for code</li>
    <li><strong>Fallback:</strong> the "System Fonts" option in the A11y menu applies <code>.system-fonts</code> to <code>&lt;html&gt;</code>, swapping everything to the system UI stack</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-3">Defined in <code>src/assets/css/tailwind.css</code>:</p>
  <pre class="mt-2"><code class="language-css">body {
  font-family: 'Public Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
    'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
}
h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6,
.font-bold, .font-semibold {
  font-family: 'Young Serif', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
    'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
}
.system-fonts {
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI',
    Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
}</code></pre>
  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-3">To change fonts:</p>
  <ol class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 list-decimal pl-6">
    <li>Update the Google Fonts <code>&lt;link&gt;</code> in <code>src/_includes/layouts/base.njk</code>.</li>
    <li>Update the <code>font-family</code> rules in <code>src/assets/css/tailwind.css</code> shown above.</li>
  </ol>
</section>

